---
title: "图 05：外部 Stage 幂等恢复状态机"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OwnerReadback

    state "Owner 权威回读" as OwnerReadback
    state "CAS 预留 Mutation Attempt" as ReserveAttempt
    state "持久化 reserved" as PersistReserved
    state "执行一次外部 Mutation" as ExternalMutation
    state "强制 Post-Mutation Readback" as PostMutationReadback
    state "有界等待与读取授权" as Wait
    state "推进下一 Stage" as Advance
    state "Manual Review" as ManualReview

    OwnerReadback --> Advance: ready
    OwnerReadback --> ReserveAttempt: absent 且有 Mutation Budget
    OwnerReadback --> Wait: pending 且有 Read Budget
    OwnerReadback --> ManualReview: unknown 或 identity conflict
    ReserveAttempt --> PersistReserved
    PersistReserved --> ExternalMutation
    ExternalMutation --> PostMutationReadback
    PostMutationReadback --> Advance: ready
    PostMutationReadback --> Wait: pending
    PostMutationReadback --> ManualReview: unknown 或 conflict
    Wait --> OwnerReadback: 获得下一次读取授权
    Wait --> ManualReview: Read Budget 耗尽
    Advance --> [*]
    ManualReview --> [*]
